<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN BANKING STATISTICS - UPDATED MARCH 14.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN BANKING STATISTICS - UPDATED MARCH 14.</headline>
<text>
<p>(Updates with growth in M1, M2, broad money and central bank</p>
<p>refinancing as of February 28)</p>
<p>Central exchange rate-Bulgarian National Bank (BNB) daily fix:</p>
<p>Levs/dollar 1,569.00 (Mar14) 495.74 (Dec30) 70.719 (Dec30'95)</p>
<p>Broad money in billion levs:</p>
<p>3,444.6(Feb28) 2,017.2(Jan31) 1,305.6(Dec27) 1,013.7(Nov29)</p>
<p>M1 pct change  +61.60 (Feb28-Jan 31)</p>
<p>M2 pct change  +70.24 (Feb28-Jan 31)</p>
<p>Central bank total refinancing in billion levs:</p>
<p>55.874 (Feb28) 59.584 (Jan 31) 62.336 (Dec27) 59.186 (Nov29)</p>
<p>Central interest rate (CIR): 18.0 pct monthly (216 pct</p>
<p>annually) from March 1 (198 pct Jan 28-Feb 28)</p>
<p>BNB monthly repo rate: 7 pct (1-2 days)</p>
<p>Money market lev funds rate, annual - 216-231 pct</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-84561</p>
</text>
